{"parentUuid":"9479e6aa-0dc0-4a75-9c48-798e4af396f1","isSidechain":false,"attachment":{"type":"task_reminder","content":[{"id":"32","subject":"PR-prep sweep + docs for #633 (awaiting user go)","description":"Before opening PR #633: full workspace clippy (--workspace --all-targets, touch changed files first) + tests (faucet-core, faucet-source-rest, faucet-sink-bigquery) + patch coverage; docs — cookbook/reference for native byte-passthrough + JSON logging note; maintenance docs-sync surfaces; connectors.md/architecture.md notes. No commits/PR until user says done. Fork: user may want Arrow columnar (#635) first.","activeForm":"Prepping #633 PR sweep + docs","status":"pending","blocks":[],"blockedBy":[]},{"id":"33","subject":"Clean concurrency re-sweep (6/8/10) after Meltano sync done — ON HOLD","description":"HOLD on all Salesforce/BQ runs to conserve credits/quota. The mc=8 wall-time varied 18.7↔22.1 min — attributed to a concurrent Meltano full sync contending for the shared lexipol org's Bulk API. Once Meltano's sync completes, re-run the concurrency sweep (6/8/10 at 50k) in the uncontended org to get a clean comparison. Memory result is robust regardless (~140-185MB flat). Do NOT trigger until user confirms Meltano is done.","activeForm":"Holding for clean concurrency re-sweep","status":"pending","blocks":[],"blockedBy":[]},{"id":"34","subject":"#630: incremental replication for Salesforce Bulk / async_job","description":"Inject WHERE <replication_key> > <bookmark> into the submit SOQL (clause-aware); emit run-start timestamp as the new bookmark (native-compatible, no data parse); wire into both stream_pages_inner (Value path) and stream_native (#633). Reuse replication_method/replication_key/start_replication_value/runtime_start. Pure SOQL-injection helper + wiremock tests. Composes with write_mode upsert for a true mirror.","activeForm":"Implementing #630 incremental Salesforce Bulk","status":"completed","blocks":[],"blockedBy":[]},{"id":"35","subject":"#639: 