{"parentUuid":"f22778a8-a8f6-44c5-861a-f0f68de156aa","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-8","id":"msg_011Ceamn9bLBpRxUSuXqhQtq","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Done and pushed — **`f72086e5`** on the branch. This was the autonomous pass you asked for: I fixed the issues, verified every change with headless Chrome in **both light and dark**, and cleaned up the throwaway scan instance.\n\n## Fixed + verified (hard-refresh the console)\n- **Runs is now the same aligned, sticky table as Datasets** (shared `.ds-table`) — consistent look across list views.\n- **Numbers comma-grouped everywhere** via a shared `utils.fmtInt` (Runs, dataset detail, lineage tooltips), and the redundant \"rows\"/\"run\" words dropped where a column/label already says it.\n- **Sticky header pins to the window top** — no more row peeking above it (the nav was scrolling away, leaving a gap).\n- **Dark-mode chevron bug fixed** — the timezone `<select>` no longer shows the row of overlapping arrows (a `background` shorthand was resetting `background-repeat` and tiling the chevron).\n- **URI cell**: hidden scrollbar + right-edge fade (scrollbar no longer sits on the text; fade signals there's more).\n- **Local-outputs rows aligned** — fixed grid columns, so the PRESENT badge, age, date and buttons line up across rows (your #57).\n- **Lineage node labels fit their boxes** — right column no longer clipped; lighter nodes; 0 crossings.\n\nVerified in dark mode: datasets table clean, chevron single, numbers grouped, fade works.\n\n## Added the workflow rule\nPer your request, I added a **\"Live UI verification\"** section to `CLAUDE.md`: any non-trivial `serve-ui` change must be rendered in a real browser (the `--no-auth` throwaway + headless Chrome loop), checked in **both themes**, and exercised on the clickables — with the exact commands. (That file is gitignored in this repo, so it stays local, as intended.)\n\n## Three lower-priority items I deliberately left (say the word and I'll finish)\n1. **\"Volume (recent runs)\" still looks sparse** with a single run — I didn't change its empty/near-empty state yet.\n2. **Local-outputs management controls** (show-cleaned · days · Purge · Clean · refresh) aren't behind a \"Manage\" disclosure yet.\n3. **Templates** is still its card+header style, not the exact `.ds-table` (it works, but isn't pixel-identical to the others).\n\nWant me to knock those three out too, or leave them for now?"}],"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2894,"cache_read_input_tokens":893771,"output_tokens":1409,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":574},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2894,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"not_available","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":1409,"cache_read_input_tokens":893771,"cache_creation_input_tokens":2894,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":2894},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null},"requestId":"req_011Ceammkt6CyMcZ8kV9TXtD","type":"assistant","uuid":"d9479665-8fc6-4318-ba96-09d4a9dc9138","timestamp":"2026-08-31T11:48:10.737Z","effort":"high","session_id":"55398c64-7c65-40db-9b68-886111a86d7f","userType":"external","entrypoint":"cli","cwd":"/Users/c-sikawats/Documents/GitHub/Personal/faucet-stream","sessionId":"55398c64-7c65-40db-9b68-886111a86d7f","version":"2.1.231","gitBranch":"feat/native-byte-passthrough-633","slug":"linear-noodling-leaf"}
